I think it's possible to load a library on each datanode R instance before mapper and reducer. I want to use the library(arules) function -- apriori()  in the mapper and reducer, how can I load  arules on each datanode? Or how can I make it possible to use apriori() function in mapper and reducer?

My goal is to implement parallel frequent itemset generating using apiori().
Thanks.

