> library(rmr2)
> library(MASS)
> from.dfs(mapreduce(to.dfs(1:10), map = function(k,v) rlm(x = rnorm(10), y = rnorm(10))))

You only need to have MASS installed on each node to be able to use rlm in the map function. Should be just the same with arules and apriori.

